# This directory contains resume sources and generated files.
#
# Sources (tracked):
# - _template.typ         : Shared Typst layout primitives
# - resume-swe.typ        : Software-engineering resume source
# - resume-academic.typ   : Academic CV source
#
# Generated (built by GitHub Actions on every push to main):
# - resume-swe.pdf        : Software-engineering resume PDF
# - resume-academic.pdf   : Academic CV PDF
# - resume.pdf            : Alias of resume-swe.pdf (kept for backwards-compat)
#
# All resume content lives in ../_data/*.yml. Edit there, not here.
